<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SecurityFocus</title>
    <meta name="description" content="SecurityFocus is back. Bugtraq lives again. Subscribe to the curated vulnerability disclosure mailing list.">
    <meta property="og:title" content="BUGTRAQ IS BACK">
    <meta property="og:description" content="Bugtraq, the legendary vulnerability disclosure mailing list, is back under community stewardship.">
    <meta property="og:type" content="website">
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://securityfocus.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/favicon.ico">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="/favicon-16x16.png">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon-32x32.png">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="96x96" href="/favicon-96x96.png">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="120x120" href="/apple-120.png">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="152x152" href="/apple-152.png">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="167x167" href="/apple-167.png">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/apple-180.png">
    <style>
        *, *::before, *::after {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        :root {
            --bg: #0a0a0a;
            --surface: #111111;
            --border: #1a1a1a;
            --text: #e8e8e8;
            --text-dim: #707070;
            --accent: #c41200;
            --accent-glow: rgba(196, 18, 0, 0.15);
            --mono: 'Space Mono', monospace;
            --sans: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
        }

        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            *, *::before, *::after {
                animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
                transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
            }
        }

        html {
            font-size: 16px;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }

        body {
            background: var(--bg);
            color: var(--text);
            font-family: var(--sans);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        /* ── Hero ── */
        .hero {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 70vh;
            padding: 4rem 2rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .hero-logo {
            font-family: var(--mono);
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 400;
            letter-spacing: 0.4em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .hero-statement {
            font-family: var(--mono);
            font-size: clamp(3rem, 10vw, 7rem);
            font-weight: 700;
            line-height: 1.05;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            color: var(--text);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .hero-statement .period {
            color: var(--accent);
        }

        .cursor {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 0.55em;
            height: 1.05em;
            background: var(--accent);
            margin-left: 0.05em;
            vertical-align: text-bottom;
            animation: blink 1s step-end infinite;
        }

        @keyframes blink {
            50% { opacity: 0; }
        }

        .hero-sub {
            font-family: var(--mono);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            margin-top: 2rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.15em;
        }

        /* ── Divider ── */
        .divider {
            width: 60px;
            height: 1px;
            background: var(--accent);
            margin: 0 auto;
            opacity: 0.6;
        }

        /* ── Content ── */
        .content {
            max-width: 680px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 4rem 2rem 6rem;
        }

        .content p {
            font-family: var(--sans);
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            font-weight: 300;
            line-height: 1.75;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .content p strong {
            color: var(--text);
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        /* ── Lists section ── */
        .lists {
            max-width: 680px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 2rem 5rem;
        }

        .lists h2 {
            font-family: var(--mono);
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 400;
            letter-spacing: 0.4em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .list-card {
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
        }

        .list-card:hover {
            border-color: var(--accent);
            background: var(--accent-glow);
        }

        .list-card h3 {
            font-family: var(--mono);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .list-card .address {
            font-family: var(--mono);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--accent);
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        }

        .list-card p {
            font-family: var(--sans);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 300;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            margin: 0;
        }

        .list-card .actions {
            margin-top: 1.25rem;
            display: flex;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .list-card .actions a {
            font-family: var(--mono);
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--text);
            text-decoration: none;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding-bottom: 2px;
            transition: border-color 0.2s, color 0.2s;
        }

        .list-card .actions a:hover {
            color: var(--accent);
            border-color: var(--accent);
        }

        /* ── Footer ── */
        footer {
            margin-top: auto;
            padding: 3rem 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        }

        footer p {
            font-family: var(--mono);
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        }

        footer a {
            color: var(--text-dim);
            text-decoration: none;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            transition: color 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
        }

        footer a:hover {
            color: var(--text);
            border-color: var(--text);
        }

        /* ── Focus ── */
        a:focus-visible {
            outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
            outline-offset: 3px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-logo">SecurityFocus</div>
        <h1 class="hero-statement">
            WE ARE BACK<span class="period">.</span><span class="cursor"></span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">bugtraq@securityfocus.com — est. 1993</p>
    </section>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <section class="content">
        <p>
            <strong>Bugtraq was the security community's mailing list.</strong>
            Founded in 1993 by Scott Chasin, it became the primary channel for
            vulnerability disclosure, security advisories, and original research
            for over two decades. When it mattered, it was on Bugtraq.
        </p>
        <p>
            After Symantec's acquisition of SecurityFocus in 2002, the list
            slowly declined. Broadcom stopped updating the BID database in 2019.
            Accenture acquired the remains in 2020, tried to shut Bugtraq down,
            reversed course under community pressure, then went permanently
            silent. The last message was posted January 17, 2021.
        </p>
        <p>
            <strong>SecurityFocus is now under independent, community stewardship.</strong>
            Bugtraq is live again — curated, moderated, and open to submissions from
            security researchers worldwide. We're also launching a second list
            dedicated to vulnerability research in AI and machine learning systems.
        </p>
        <p>
            The historical Bugtraq archives are preserved by
            <a href="https://seclists.org/bugtraq/" style="color: var(--text); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">Seclists</a> (1993-2021), 
            <a href="https://marc.info/?l=bugtraq" style="color: var(--text); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">MARC</a> (1993–2021) and
            <a href="https://lists.openwall.net/bugtraq/" style="color: var(--text); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">Openwall</a> (2003–2021).
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="lists">
        <h2>Mailing Lists</h2>

        <div class="list-card">
            <h3>Bugtraq</h3>
            <div class="address">bugtraq@securityfocus.com</div>
            <p>
                Curated vulnerability disclosure and security advisory mailing list.
                All targets — proprietary, open source, hardware, firmware, embedded.
                Moderated for quality. The continuation of the original Bugtraq.
            </p>
            <div class="actions">
                <a href="https://lists.securityfocus.com/postorius/lists/bugtraq.securityfocus.com/">Subscribe</a>
                <a href="https://lists.securityfocus.com/hyperkitty/list/bugtraq@securityfocus.com/">Archives</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="list-card">
            <h3>Bugtraq AI</h3>
            <div class="address">bugtraq@bugtraq.ai</div>
            <p>
                Vulnerability disclosures and security research focused on AI/ML
                systems — model exploits, inference attacks, training data poisoning,
                framework vulnerabilities, and adversarial machine learning.
            </p>
            <div class="actions">
                <a href="https://lists.securityfocus.com/postorius/lists/bugtraq.bugtraq.ai/">Subscribe</a>
                <a href="https://lists.securityfocus.com/hyperkitty/list/bugtraq@bugtraq.ai/">Archives</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>
            SecurityFocus is operated by <a href="https://psirt.com">PSIRT</a>
            &nbsp;·&nbsp;
            <a href="https://bugtraq.io">bugtraq.io</a>
            &nbsp;·&nbsp;
            <a href="https://bugtraq.ai">bugtraq.ai</a>
        </p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
